    "The pack changes mod configuration only. It does not install mods, restore DLLs, or modify ModsWritable data.",
    "The Mac Blur Glass profile is captured from the original 10-mod kit; Default Windows disables those mods in merge mode and preserves their settings.",
    "Absolute themePaths and themeFolder settings are machine-specific and are omitted from the shipped profile. The built-in iconTheme option is portable and retained.",
    "Windhawk reloads after the registry change; no service restart is required.",
    "The profile disables no unlisted mods by default. A duplicated user profile may opt into disabling all others."
